<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Maria Caroliny - Brazilian Lawyer, Civil and Consumer Law, and Master's Student in Business.">
  <title>Maria Caroliny | Brazilian Lawyer & Business Graduate Student</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #0B1F33;
      --dark-blue: #164E73;
      --teal: #2D7FA3;
      --gold: #C9A45C;
      --off-white: #F7F5F0;
      --white: #FFFFFF;
      --charcoal: #263746;
      --gray: #687786;
      --light-gray: #E2E8EC;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--charcoal);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    a { text-decoration: none; }

    nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      background: rgba(11, 31, 51, 0.97);
      padding: 18px 8%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      transition: 0.3s ease;
    }

    .logo {
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .logo span { color: var(--gold); }

    nav ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      gap: 25px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #E7EEF2;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: 0.3s ease;
    }

    nav a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

    .hero {
      min-height: 88vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 80px 8%;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: linear-gradient(125deg, var(--navy), var(--dark-blue));
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 520px;
      height: 520px;
      right: -180px;
      top: -140px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(201, 164, 92, 0.25);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 350px;
      height: 350px;
      right: 80px;
      bottom: -220px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 900px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--gold);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 82px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero h1 span { color: var(--gold); }

    .hero h2 {
      color: #D9E5EC;
      font-size: clamp(21px, 3vw, 30px);
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #C5D4DD;
      max-width: 720px;
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 15px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 25px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: 0.3s ease;
    }

    .button-primary {
      background: var(--gold);
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .button-primary:hover {
      background: #D8B975;
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .button-outline {
      color: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
    }

    .button-outline:hover {
      color: var(--gold);
      border-color: var(--gold);
    }

    section { padding: 90px 8%; }

    .section-container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .section-label {
      color: var(--teal);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .section-title {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 38px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .section-intro {
      max-width: 720px;
      color: var(--gray);
      margin-bottom: 45px;
    }

    .about-section { background: var(--off-white); }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 60px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .about-text p {
      color: #4D5D69;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .profile-card {
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 35px;
      border: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(11, 31, 51, 0.08);
    }

    .profile-card h3 {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .profile-item {
      padding: 16px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
    }

    .profile-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

    .profile-item strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--dark-blue);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    .profile-item span { color: var(--gray); }

    .education-section { background: var(--white); }

    .education-card {
      background: #FAFAFA;
      padding: 28px 32px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    }

    .education-card h3 {
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .education-card .location {
      color: var(--teal);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .education-card p { color: var(--gray); }

    .background-section { background: var(--navy); }

    .background-section .section-label { color: var(--gold); }
    .background-section .section-title { color: var(--white); }
    .background-section .section-intro { color: #C3D1D9; }

    .background-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .background-card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 9px;
    }

    .background-card h3 {
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .background-card p { color: #C4D0D8; }

    .business-section { background: var(--white); }

    .business-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .business-card {
      padding: 35px;
      background: var(--off-white);
      border-radius: 10px;
      border-top: 3px solid var(--dark-blue);
    }

    .business-card h3 {
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .business-card p { color: var(--gray); }

    .skills-section { background: var(--off-white); }

    .skills-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .skill {
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 25px;
      border: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: 0.3s ease;
    }

    .skill:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 25px rgba(11,31,51,0.08);
    }

    .skill-number {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .skill h3 {
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .skill p {
      color: var(--gray);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .interests-section { background: var(--white); }

    .interest-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .interest {
      padding: 11px 19px;
      border: 1px solid #CBD7DF;
      border-radius: 30px;
      color: var(--dark-blue);
      background: #F8FAFB;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: 0.3s ease;
    }

    .interest:hover {
      border-color: var(--gold);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .goals-section { background: var(--off-white); }

    .goals-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .goal {
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 30px;
      border-top: 3px solid var(--dark-blue);
      border-radius: 9px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(11,31,51,0.05);
    }

    .goal h3 {
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .goal p { color: var(--gray); }

    .opportunities-section { background: var(--white); }

    .opportunity-box {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy), var(--dark-blue));
      padding: 45px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: var(--white);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .opportunity-box::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 250px;
      height: 250px;
      right: -80px;
      top: -100px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,164,92,0.2);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .opportunity-box h3 {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .opportunity-box p {
      color: #C8D5DD;
      max-width: 800px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .opportunity-box strong { color: var(--white); }

    .projects-section { background: var(--off-white); }

    .project-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--light-gray);
      padding: 35px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      transition: 0.3s ease;
    }

    .project-card:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(11,31,51,0.08);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .project-card h3 {
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .project-card p {
      color: var(--gray);
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .project-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      background: #EDF4F7;
      color: var(--dark-blue);
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .contact-section {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark-blue), var(--navy));
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact-section .section-label { color: var(--gold); }
    .contact-section .section-title { color: var(--white); }

    .contact-section .section-intro {
      color: #C6D3DB;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .contact-buttons {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 15px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .contact-email {
      color: var(--white);
      margin-top: 25px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    footer {
      background: #071521;
      color: #8797A3;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    footer span { color: var(--gold); }

    @media (max-width: 850px) {
      nav {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 15px;
      }

      nav ul {
        gap: 14px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 80vh;
        padding: 70px 7%;
      }

      .about-grid,
      .business-content,
      .background-grid,
      .goals-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .skills-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }

      section { padding: 70px 7%; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .skills-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

      .hero h1 { font-size: 45px; }
      .hero h2 { font-size: 21px; }
      .hero p { font-size: 16px; }

      .section-title { font-size: 31px; }

      .profile-card,
      .opportunity-box,
      .project-card {
        padding: 25px;
      }

      .buttons {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: stretch;
      }

      .button {
        width: 100%;
        text-align: center;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav id="navbar">
    <div class="logo">Maria <span>Caroliny</span></div>

    <ul>
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#education">Education</a></li>
      <li><a href="#background">Legal Background</a></li>
      <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
      <li><a href="#goals">Goals</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">

      <div class="eyebrow">Law • Business • Technology</div>

      <h1>Maria <span>Caroliny</span></h1>

      <h2>
        Brazilian Lawyer | Civil & Consumer Law | Master's Student in Business
      </h2>

      <p>
        Brazilian lawyer with a professional background in Civil and Consumer
        Law, currently pursuing a Master's degree in Business and developing
        a growing interest in how technology and artificial intelligence can
        be applied to business.
      </p>

      <div class="buttons">
        <!-- Add your LinkedIn URL in the href below -->
        <a
          href="#"
          class="button button-primary"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          View LinkedIn
        </a>

        <a href="#about" class="button button-outline">
          Explore My Profile
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </header>

  <section id="about" class="about-section">
    <div class="section-container">

      <div class="about-grid">

        <div class="about-text">

          <div class="section-label">About Me</div>

          <h2 class="section-title">
            A legal background with a business perspective.
          </h2>

          <p>
            I am a Brazilian lawyer with a Law degree and professional
            experience in Brazil, with a primary background in Civil
            and Consumer Law.
          </p>

          <p>
            I completed my Law degree in December 2018 and developed
            my professional background in the legal field in Brazil.
          </p>

          <p>
            Currently, I am pursuing a Master's degree in Business at
            Caroline University, expanding my knowledge beyond traditional
            legal practice and developing a broader understanding of
            business, management, and strategic decision-making.
          </p>

          <p>
            Alongside my Business studies, I have a growing professional
            interest in how technology and artificial intelligence can
            be applied to business and organizations.
          </p>

        </div>

        <div class="profile-card">

          <h3>Professional Profile</h3>

          <div class="profile-item">
            <strong>Professional Background</strong>
            <span>Brazilian Lawyer</span>
          </div>

          <div class="profile-item">
            <strong>Legal Practice Areas</strong>
            <span>Civil & Consumer Law</span>
          </div>

          <div class="profile-item">
            <strong>Law Degree</strong>
            <span>Completed December 2018</span>
          </div>

          <div class="profile-item">
            <strong>Current Education</strong>
            <span>Master's Degree in Business</span>
          </div>

          <div class="profile-item">
            <strong>Current Academic Focus</strong>
            <span>Business</span>
          </div>

          <div class="profile-item">
            <strong>Professional Interests</strong>
            <span>Business, Technology & AI Applications</span>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="education" class="education-section">
    <div class="section-container">

      <div class="section-label">Education</div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Academic Background</h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        My academic background combines legal education with
        graduate-level business studies.
      </p>

      <div class="education-card">

        <h3>Law Degree</h3>

        <div class="location">
          Estácio de Sá — Vitória, Espírito Santo, Brazil
        </div>

        <p>
          Completed in December 2018. Academic training in Law,
          with a professional focus on Civil and Consumer Law.
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="education-card">

        <h3>Master's Degree in Business</h3>

        <div class="location">
          Caroline University • Currently Pursuing
        </div>

        <p>
          Graduate studies focused on business knowledge, management,
          strategy, organizations, and professional development.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="background" class="background-section">
    <div class="section-container">

      <div class="section-label">Legal Background</div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Civil & Consumer Law</h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        My professional legal background in Brazil is primarily in
        Civil and Consumer Law, developing skills that can also be
        applied across different professional environments.
      </p>

      <div class="background-grid">

        <div class="background-card">
          <h3>Civil Law</h3>
          <p>
            Professional background in Civil Law, applying legal
            reasoning and analysis to civil matters.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="background-card">
          <h3>Consumer Law</h3>
          <p>
            Professional background in Consumer Law and analysis
            of issues involving consumer relationships and rights.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="background-card">
          <h3>Legal Research</h3>
          <p>
            Ability to research legal information, identify relevant
            sources, and organize complex information.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="background-card">
          <h3>Legal Analysis</h3>
          <p>
            Ability to analyze legal issues through structured
            reasoning and careful evaluation of information.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="business-section">
    <div class="section-container">

      <div class="section-label">Business & Technology</div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Expanding Beyond Law</h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        My current academic focus is Business, complemented by a growing
        interest in how technology and artificial intelligence can be
        applied to business, strategy, and organizational decision-making.
      </p>

      <div class="business-content">

        <div class="business-card">
          <h3>Law + Business</h3>
          <p>
            My legal background and Business studies allow me to develop
            a broader perspective on organizations, decision-making,
            strategy, and professional challenges.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="business-card">
          <h3>Technology + AI in Business</h3>
          <p>
            I am particularly interested in understanding how technology
            and artificial intelligence can be applied to business,
            organizations, and strategic decision-making.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="skills" class="skills-section">
    <div class="section-container">

      <div class="section-label">Core Skills</div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Professional Skills</h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        Skills developed through legal education, professional experience,
        graduate studies, and continuous learning.
      </p>

      <div class="skills-grid">

        <div class="skill">
          <div class="skill-number">01</div>
          <h3>Legal Research</h3>
          <p>Researching and organizing legal information and sources.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
          <div class="skill-number">02</div>
          <h3>Legal Analysis</h3>
          <p>Analyzing information through structured legal reasoning.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
          <div class="skill-number">03</div>
          <h3>Critical Thinking</h3>
          <p>Evaluating information and considering different perspectives.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
          <div class="skill-number">04</div>
          <h3>Communication</h3>
          <p>Organizing ideas and communicating information clearly.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
          <div class="skill-number">05</div>
          <h3>Problem Solving</h3>
          <p>Approaching challenges through structured analysis.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
          <div class="skill-number">06</div>
          <h3>Business</h3>
          <p>Developing knowledge in management, organizations, and business strategy.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
          <div class="skill-number">07</div>
          <h3>Organization</h3>
          <p>Managing information and approaching tasks in a structured way.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
          <div class="skill-number">08</div>
          <h3>Technology in Business</h3>
          <p>Exploring the role of technology in modern business environments.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
          <div class="skill-number">09</div>
          <h3>AI in Business</h3>
          <p>Developing a professional interest in AI applications within business and organizations.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="interests-section">
    <div class="section-container">

      <div class="section-label">Professional Interests</div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Areas That Interest Me</h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        My interests reflect the intersection between my legal background,
        current Business studies, and my curiosity about emerging technologies.
      </p>

      <div class="interest-list">

        <div class="interest">Civil Law</div>
        <div class="interest">Consumer Law</div>
        <div class="interest">Business</div>
        <div class="interest">Business Strategy</div>
        <div class="interest">Technology in Business</div>
        <div class="interest">Artificial Intelligence in Business</div>
        <div class="interest">Entrepreneurship</div>
        <div class="interest">Leadership</div>
        <div class="interest">Innovation</div>
        <div class="interest">Professional Development</div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="goals" class="goals-section">
    <div class="section-container">

      <div class="section-label">Future Direction</div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Professional Goals</h2>

      <p class="section-intro">
        My goal is to continue building a multidisciplinary professional
        profile by combining my legal background with Business and an
        interest in technology and artificial intelligence.
      </p>

      <div class="goals-grid">

        <div class="goal">
          <h3>Expand My Business Knowledge</h3>
          <p>
            Continue developing my understanding of management,
            strategy, organizations, and business decision-making.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="goal">
          <h3>Connect Law & Business</h3>
          <p>
            Explore opportunities where my legal background and
            Business education can complement each other.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="goal">
          <h3>Explore Technology & AI in Business</h3>
          <p>
            Develop a stronger understanding of how technology and
            artificial intelligence can create value for businesses
            and organizations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="goal">
          <h3>Build a Global Perspective</h3>
          <p>
            Continue developing professionally in an international
            environment and expand my knowledge across different fields.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="opportunities-section">
    <div class="section-container">

      <div class="section-label">Career Direction</div>

      <h2 class="section-title">Open to Professional Opportunities</h2>

      <div class="opportunity-box">

        <h3>A Multidisciplinary Professional Profile</h3>

        <p>
          I am open to exploring professional opportunities where my
          legal background, Business education, analytical skills,
          and professional interests can contribute to an organization.
        </p>

        <p>
          I am particularly interested in opportunities related to
          <strong>
